            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Reardon, S.F. & C. Galindo. (2007). Patterns of Hispanic Students' Math Skill Proficiency in the Early Elementary Grades.  Journal of Latinos and Education 6(3): 229-252.",
